WEBVTT

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.160
What is everybody doing?

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:43.980
Squid Girlie! The super hero
show is about to start.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.830
<b>Up for an inkredible
Hero Stage Show?</b>

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Hello, everybody!

00:01:54.070 --> 00:02:02.340
Super Hero Show

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.750
Hello!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.200
What the squid is this?

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.090
All right, it's finally time
for the super hero show.

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.010
Yay!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:08.060
Let's all yell the super
hero's name!

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.510
Ready!

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.670
Noh Mask Rider!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:19.710
Eeek, everybody, watch out,
it's the Black Tights Army!

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:29.080
Hah, everybody is so childish for
getting squidly excited about this.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:33.330
Oh, no. You weren't
energetic enough.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.000
The Black Tights Army
was able to appear.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.600
Let's put more gusto into it and
call her one more time.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.720
Ready.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:44.180
Noh Mask Rider!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:49.420
I am Noh Mask Rider, the woman
who can show all human

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.940
emotions with one expression!

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:00.570
That's a squidding ridiculous hero.
And it's just a noh mask!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.930
It ends here, Noh Mask Rider.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.780
Squid squid squid!

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:17.780
I am the Squid Demon.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.460
My stomach hurts.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:23.090
I will punish the humans
who pollute the ocean!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.810
Over my dead body!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.180
Don't make me laugh.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.770
You won't be so tough when
I'm done with you!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:42.570
Oh no! Noh Mask Rider
is in trouble!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.320
Everybody, you need
to cheer her on!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.540
You can do it!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:47.740
Don't give in, Rider!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.500
Come on, Squid Girlie,
you have to cheer, too.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.740
Go, Squid Demon!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.210
Huh, that one?

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.210
Don't lose!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.350
Hey, Squid Girlie is cheering
on the Squid Demon.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:03.610
But the woman said we should
cheer for Noh Mask Rider.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.960
You know, the Squid Demon's
not bad either.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.580
When you think about it, Noh Mask
Rider doesn't look that cool.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.490
And it's a noh mask.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.890
All right, let's switch, too.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.240
Ready.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.320
Go Squid Demon!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:18.320
What?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.320
You can do it!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.870
What should we do?
This is really uncomfortable.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.660
They might flip out if the Squid
Demon's defeated here.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.070
Can't you do something?

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.830
What am I supposed to...

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:35.820
Uh, the incredible fight between
the two rages on.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:39.940
Don't miss the conclusion
in 10 minutes!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.790
Oh man, I never expected
it to go like this...

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:51.000
I guess we picked the
wrong monster.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:55.350
Maybe the kids around
here are weird...

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:01.210
Maybe the kids would like it better
if the Squid Demon just won.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:04.200
Aren't we going to get in
trouble if we do that?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.910
But the Squid Demon can't
just be defeated either...

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.290
How about having the Squid Demon
evolve into the Octopus Demon?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.730
I only brought the Squid
Demon costume.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:20.880
How about having a lengthy discussion
that ends in reconciliation?

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.400
Yeah!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.720
That sounds like it might
work. Let's go!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.980
The costume is gone!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.900
Squid squid squuuuid.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:36.900
Who the...?!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.900
And there are more tentacles...

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.630
I can't let these adults ring in
the Squid Demon's defeat.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:47.260
The Squid Demon shall
be victorious!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.240
Squid squid squid.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:52.410
In any case, I have to
retrieve the suit.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.890
Come at me, Squid Demon!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.470
You can't command me!

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:02.660
Go, Squid Demon!

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:07.960
Who knew that being cheered on
by a crowd would feel so good?

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:10.180
I will crush you, Noh Mask Rider!

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.310
Eat my tentacle attack!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.520
Enough, Squid Demon!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:20.980
Who are you?!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.110
I will bring down the
evil of the world!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.710
I am the woman who expresses all the
human emotions with just wrath!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.730
I am Noh Mask Rider Hannya!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.660
Or simply HN.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.140
Squid?

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.360
Hannya?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.810
Or HN.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.130
What does that mean?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.650
Who is that?

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.090
I don't care anymore.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.200
I'll set it up so you
can finish him off.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.050
Sure...

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.210
It doesn't matter if there's
one more loser,

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:59.970
you will both be destroyed
by my tentacles of doom!

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.150
Damn you!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:11.860
Now!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.030
This voice...

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.990
Noh Mask Rider Diving Cross Chop!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.580
Barnacles...

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.650
Oh, I won...

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:28.920
Wow!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.800
Noh Mask Rider is cool after all!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.590
Noh Mask Rider is awesome!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.830
A woman fights for justice
and vanquishes evil.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.350
She can show all human emotions
with just one expression.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:44.320
Her name is Noh Mask Rider!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.780
Her traumatic past helps her

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.650
unleash her true power.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:02.080
Underneath the cultural heritage
mask are tears.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.010
Noh Mask Rider

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.840
Noh Mask Rider

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:13.010
Let your rage burn while
you search for yourself!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:16.010
Hannya never appeared.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.820
I don't think there's really a character
like that in the show.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.740
But she was there today.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.980
Maybe she only appears
during live shows.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:34.570
<b>Squidn't you be studying right now?</b>

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.670
This is hard...

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.160
What are you moaning about?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.570
Whoa! Oh, it's you.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.020
What is this?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.700
Math problems.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:46.940
Math?

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.640
What the squid is math?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.500
You want me to explain
it from scratch?!

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:54.970
If I could, I could easily
solve this problem!

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:56.460
Uh huh.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.210
Don't act like you know
the answer.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.020
I wouldn't be suffering if I could
understand it after reading it once.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:06.940
The answer to this problem
is x^2 + 10x + 25.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.620
Yeah, right. Nice try.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.480
It's correct... why?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.890
I bet you looked at
the answer page!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.970
I sure as squid did not!

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.330
Then solve this one.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:27.290
X equals zero.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.070
It's correct... Then this one!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.980
X equals plus or minus the
square root of seven.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.720
Then how about this?!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.770
Eat it! It's from Japan's hardest...

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:02.160
If it was just math, she could get
into Tokyo University easily...

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.180
Wow, Squid Girlie! You're a genius!

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.410
A genius? Me?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:10.890
True. I mean you immediately picked
up Japanese, games, etc,

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:13.820
so I already thought that your
adaptive abilities were quite high.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:15.050
You could get a Nobel prize!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.500
There is no Nobel prize
for mathematics.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.390
If anything, I would get
the Fields Medal.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.860
That weirdly skewed knowledge
and your math prowess...

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:26.360
do you have a calculator
in there or what?!

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.370
Ow, what are you
squidding doing?!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.350
Squids die if you take that off!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:34.570
You know, for me it's weirder that you
get stuck on <i>this</i> stuff.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.780
<i>This</i> stuff?

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.610
It's easy because the way
to solve it is predefined.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.120
E-E-Easy...

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.230
Good for you, Eiko.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:48.250
You can get help from Squiddie.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.620
Stop messing with me!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.980
There is nothing Squid Girl
could ever teach me!

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:59.510
Just you watch!
I will solve this in a heartbeat by myself!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.630
What is she getting so
worked up about?

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.220
She can't bear that you
beat her at something.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.810
Not that she could win
against a genius.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.100
Genius?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.990
Genius?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.340
I don't understand a thing.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:20.780
How the hell did she
solve this so quickly?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.860
Is there an easy way to solve it?

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.490
Curry Tunak

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:27.490
I got it!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.320
Hey, Squid Girl!

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:35.000
I bet you know a special calculation method
like the Indian method, right?!

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.050
That's why you could solve
those problems so quickly.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.290
That must be it!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.570
She's scary.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.140
She must have gone crazy because
she used her head too much.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:48.600
Hey! Teach me that method!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:53.290
Is that how you ask
a genius for a favor?

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.060
She's totally looking down on me!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:12:00.530
Eiko, you have to say "please"
when you ask someone for a favor.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:02.250
Takeru, stay out of...

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.490
The next test will be easy
if I just learn the method!

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:09.980
Please teach me.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.580
Did you say something?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.120
Please teach me.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.670
I can't squidly hear you at all.

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:20.060
Why don't you get on the
ground and say "Please"?

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:26.090
It's for the test, it's for the test.
Endure it, Eiko!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:31.640
Please teach me.
I beg you, Master Squid Girl!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.440
All right, fine.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:38.610
I'll teach you if you obey me.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.940
Obey you?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:45.270
Okay, fried noodles for table 3,
Yokohama ramen table 5.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:47.480
Fried noodles 3, Yokohama 5.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.320
When you're done with
that, get some beer.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.370
Is this table free?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.200
Yes, we'll clear it right away!

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:00.250
Hey, hurry up.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.960
Hey! Don't get so cocky.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:07.800
Oh, you're talking back?
I guess you don't want to learn.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.140
Endure, Eiko!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.000
Sometimes I forget,

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.620
but I am an invader who
came to the surface

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:22.230
in order to conquer
all of humanity.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:26.190
I am going to show them how
much of a squid genius I am.

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:26.950
Then...

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.710
She solved such a
difficult problem!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.370
Her abilities are much higher
than those of humans.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.460
She is the true genius.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.020
Master Squid Girl!

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:40.420
Hey!

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.840
Can you solve this problem?

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.950
Help!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.530
I don't have time for this!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:49.930
Ah...

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:55.090
Nagisa. I am going to teach
you math today.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:59.980
Th-That's okay. Math isn't necessary
for daily life.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.070
Not necessary?

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.220
Wow, Squiddie!

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:09.370
Oh, it's nothing.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.910
Please unlock my heart, too.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.540
I don't want to unlock that!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.370
Oh!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.420
Fourier analysis and the Poisson
summation formula!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.250
You solved a high level mathematical
problem in a mere moment...

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:24.800
Finally someone who understands
my greatness...

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.840
I knew it, you must be an alien!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.430
Let's go to my lab right away!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.890
Why is that your squidding conclusion?!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.770
My dream of taking over
all of mankind...

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.060
is one step further again...

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.780
It's the plight of the genius
to be lonely in this world.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:54.510
Eiko, you're the only one
who understands me!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.190
I'm sorry for being so mean!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:00.210
It'll be all forgotten if you teach
me the calculation method.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.160
I will teach you!

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:06.460
Wh-What is this?

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.100
With that knowledge you can solve
any computational problem easily!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.250
Ow!

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.810
What are you doing?!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.180
Who could read this crap?!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.890
How can you be like that when
I just taught you the secrets?!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.430
Give me back my day!

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.370
And that other something I lost!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:25.860
Ow, that hurts.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:35.200
The wind is getting stronger,
I should get back.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:45.850
Are you okay?

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.690
Huh? I...

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.050
You were pushed under by a wave.

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:56.510
So you saved me? Thank you.

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.300
I'm just glad you're safe.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.890
The waves are quite high today;
be careful. See ya.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.350
Um, what's your name?

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:09.700
I'm Arashiyama Goro.
As a lifeguard, it's my job to protect the ocean.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.050
Bye.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:18.830
<b>Is this inkfatuation or love?</b>

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.280
You almost drowned?

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:24.110
This huge wave got me
while I was surfing...

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:27.240
Getting into it is fine, but
you have to be careful.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.030
Can you take these?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:29.500
Sure.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.840
Next time you won't just
<i>almost</i> drown.

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:38.600
Don't tell me that was the
squid person's doing...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.310
Her fear is absolutely exsquidsite!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.150
Yes, it was. I am the messenger
from the sea.

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:48.100
Controlling waves is child's play!

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:50.060
She even has such powers...

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.780
Nagisa is such a good, honest girl.

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:55.520
What are you planning
on doing to me?

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.470
Do you want to know?

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.330
EEEEK!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.170
Hey!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.390
Squidn't you stop scaring
Nagisa for no reason?

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:06.460
Hey, that's the way I squidly talk!

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.420
Can't I copy it for a squidle bit?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.630
No can squid! Give it back.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.500
The squid person's
speech pattern...

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.550
I knew it, everybody here has been
brainwashed by the squid person.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.100
I have to stay sane, at least.

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.270
Oh, hello Goro.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.850
Ch-Chizuru...

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:31.950
He-he-hello. Uhh... shrimp
fried rice please.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.980
Got it.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.780
Thank you again for yesterday.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.680
Oh, you're yesterday's...

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.070
My name is Saito Nagisa.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.990
Nice to meet you, Nagisa.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:50.230
Hey, can't leave you alone
for even a second, huh?

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.530
What's going on here?

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.310
It's not like that.

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:56.340
He saved me from drowning yesterday.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.260
Oh, I see.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:17:59.860
Well done!

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.000
He saved Nagisa?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:07.780
What the squid is he trying
to do to my Nagisa?

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.320
Oh no! Could he be trying
to reveal that

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:14.240
despite being an invader,
I'm quite friendly

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.110
and popular with everybody?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:20.690
I need Nagisa to be afraid
of me for a long time.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.550
Hey, Goro.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.220
Oh, it's the squid.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.300
Nagisa is my prey.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.210
Did she just say "prey"?!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.030
Don't get in my way!

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:35.460
I only saved her from drowning.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:39.180
And since when is Nagisa
your prey?!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.630
Yeah! And what does she
mean by prey anyway?

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.640
Am I her next brainwashing target?!

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:49.390
I got it. You're jealous of Goro.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.810
I-I'm not jealous!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:54.730
You blushed! So it is true!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.370
No, it isn't!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:59.700
Why do I have to be jealous
of this lousy flounder?

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:04.680
Hey, "lousy flounder"?!
Watch your mouth, Squid.

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:08.550
No, you watch it!
You're nothing but a human.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:09.900
What did you say?

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.770
He's calmly interacting with her.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.900
But there's no way that someone
who protects the ocean

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.240
would easily befriend an invader.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:18.060
There must be some
sort of underlying reason.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.090
Arashiyama!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.250
How do you feel about
the squid person?

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.510
Where did that come from?

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:31.940
Could Nagisa have
a crush on Goro?

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.670
If he says something weird,

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.570
the gravity of being a squid-invader
will be ruined.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:39.400
I...

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:44.630
He thinks that I am "a horrible
threat to mankind"!

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.620
Don't answer for me!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.370
I only interpreted what
your heart said.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.170
Except it was way off!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.120
I'm serious!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:57.590
I knew it. So, Nagisa
likes Goro, eh?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:02.970
A-All right. As you can see,
she's hostile towards me...

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.960
That's good.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.830
But she's liked by
children, is caring,

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.980
and when a child was drowning,
she helped me save him.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.610
So basically, she's a good person.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.390
A good person?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.860
Right, Squid?

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:23.240
He's smiling...

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.220
You must have confused
me with someone.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:28.940
I am an invader; I would never
do something like that.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.040
Don't be so shy about it.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:34.300
Arashiyama isn't afraid of the
squid person either...

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:38.170
which means that he's been
brainwashed, too!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.990
Nooo!

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.440
See what you did?

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:44.440
Thanks to you, there's one less
person who squidding gets me.

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.610
Did I say something bad?

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.700
Put your hand on your
heart and think.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.720
He's so dense...

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.900
Well, I guess he's only got
eyes for my sister.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.360
I can't wait for Chizuru's fried rice.

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:05.420
Arashiyama is the last bastion
that protects this ocean.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:09.260
The world will really end
unless he snaps out of it.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:12.330
He saved my life; what
can I do for him?

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.160
Here you go.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.520
Chizuru's fried rice...

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.670
Yummy shrimp.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:25.990
Damn you, Squid!
Gimme back Chizuru's fried rice!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:29.000
That's your squidly punishment for
saying something like that.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.240
I am not going to give up on you!

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:33.060
Huh?

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:34.770
Oh, she said it!

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:37.000
Oh, you stud.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.670
It's not like that.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:39.600
It is!

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:40.020
Wha...?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:43.480
I've made up my mind.
I am going to protect you!

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:47.150
I-I am n-not afraid of you.

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:51.490
What a relief, she's
still afraid of me.

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.790
You don't have to pretend
to be tough!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.920
Oh, I'm squidtastically happy.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:02.870
Chain of Attraction

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.880
This is getting interesting.

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:04.830
Is Squiddie here?

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:06.880
Don't make it even
more complicated!

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:44.790
Lifeguard Arashiyama Goro here!

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:45.690
Next time:

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:47.070
Focus your tentacles on her!

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:48.840
Feeling inkuisitive?

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:50.050
A squiddle work never killed anyone.

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:51.320
All three!

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:54.080
I shall keep the ocean at peace!
